    "format-version": "0.1",
    "name": "'Somatic and germline VC",
    "readme": "Calling somatic and germline variants.\nWF starts with trimmed read, performs QC of trimmed reads \nDownstream processing steps include (only main steps)\n(1) Mapping (BWA-MEM)\n(2) Filtering of reads\n(3) Removing duplicates (RmDup)\n(4) Calling variants (VarScan somatic)\n(5) Annotating variants (SnpEff)\n(6) Predicting variant effects (VEP)",
    "report": {
        "markdown": "\n# Workflow Execution Report\n\n## Workflow Inputs\n```galaxy\ninvocation_inputs()\n```\n\n## Workflow Outputs\n```galaxy\ninvocation_outputs()\n```\n\n## Workflow\n```galaxy\nworkflow_display()\n```\n"
    },
